@ Start

- Melusina
  The melody falters, but our journey is not over.

* Retry the battle. | -> Retry
* Load checkpoint. | -> LoadCheckpoint

<@> Retry

$ Notify melodia:ui:retry
? if: {ui_action_result} == unavailable
  - Melusina
    This battle cannot be restarted yet. We can return to a checkpoint instead.
  -> Start
? endif
-> End

<@> LoadCheckpoint

$ Notify melodia:ui:load_checkpoint
? if: {ui_action_result} == missing
  - Melusina
    There is no saved checkpoint yet. Let us choose another way forward.
  -> Start
? endif
? if: {ui_action_result} == refused
  - Melusina
    That checkpoint could not be loaded. Our current journey is still here.
  -> Start
? endif
-> End

<@> End
